sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant AG as Agent adapter
  participant EN as Process Engine
  participant GR as Guardrail rule set
  participant CK as Cockpit control tower
  actor TU as Reviewer (Tuấn)
  AG->>EN: agent output for APP-1042
  EN->>EN: schema gate, 7 of 7 fields pass
  EN->>GR: evaluate output
  GR-->>EN: G3 matched, allow false, LOW_CONFIDENCE_HIGH_VALUE
  EN->>EN: create "Review agent output" task, triggering identity excluded
  CK->>EN: merged inbox query across hosts
  EN-->>CK: task, masked inputs, output, schema verdict, matched row
  TU->>CK: open case, compare evidence with field cards
  alt Approve agent output
    TU->>CK: Approve
    CK->>EN: complete task, Idempotency-Key, If-Match
  else Override and approve
    TU->>CK: income 62,000,000 to 26,000,000 VND, reason, tag
    CK->>EN: complete with override diff and reason
  end
  alt 200 OK
    EN-->>CK: recorded, process continues
    CK-->>TU: outcome shown after the answer, never before
  else 409 VERSION_CONFLICT
    EN-->>CK: problem with correlationId
    CK-->>TU: reload offered, nothing marked done
  end
